        q: "What is the simplest difference between AI, ML, and deep learning?",
        a: "AI is the broad concept of machines mimicking human intelligence. Machine learning is a subset of AI where machines learn from data. Deep learning is a further subset of ML that uses neural networks with many layers to learn from very large amounts of data. Think of them as nested circles, with AI being the largest.",
